        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, to sell our products through the pharmacy channel in the United States, we are required to work with intermediaries who have the appropriate pharmacy licenses.",
        "start_character": 28295,
        "end_character": 28468
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001438133-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001438133-26-000010-3a6f219343c0769e",
        "accession_number": "0001438133-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Although we believe we are in material compliance with applicable state regulations regarding licensure requirements, if we were found to be noncompliant, we could be subject to fines and penalties or lose our licensure in that state, which could prohibit us from selling our current or future products to patients in that state.",
        "start_character": 28548,
        "end_character": 28877
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001438133-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001438133-26-000010-3a6f219343c0769e",
        "accession_number": "0001438133-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If we are not able to satisfy those special controls, we would be required to seek approval for those products under the traditional PMA submission application, which must be supported by valid scientific evidence that typically includes extensive technical, pre-clinical, clinical, manufacturing and labeling data to demonstrate to the FDA’s satisfaction the safety and efficacy of the device.",
        "start_character": 23682,
        "end_character": 24076
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001438133-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001438133-26-000010-3a6f219343c0769e",
        "accession_number": "0001438133-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Some of these states require that DME providers maintain an in-state location or retain a licensed pharmacist, and in those states, we sell our products through a third-party distributor.",
        "start_character": 28107,
        "end_character": 28294
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001438133-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001438133-26-000010-3a6f219343c0769e",
        "accession_number": "0001438133-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We anticipate that most of our future AID offerings will require supporting clinical data, either from clinical trials or potentially from evidence that we are able to collect through real-world use of our products.",
        "start_character": 24194,
        "end_character": 24409
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001438133-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001438133-26-000010-3a6f219343c0769e",
        "accession_number": "0001438133-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Furthermore, we operate in an industry characterized by extensive patent litigation, and our patents may not be upheld if challenged.",
